                    <p style="margin:0;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--ink)">Built a voice-automation pipeline on Retell AI, integrated with backend services to capture structured incident data from resident calls and automatically trigger downstream workflows — email, SMS, and admin processes.</p>
